{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"kobna-holdbrook-smith","name":"Kobna Holdbrook-Smith","birthDate":"1977-08-23","birthPlace":"Accra, Gold Coast, Ghana","bio":"Kobna Kuttah Holdbrook-Smith (born 23 August 1977) is a Ghanaian-English actor. He has played roles in films, including Father Richard Emery in Ghost Stories (2017), Oliver in The Commuter, Templeton Frye in Mary Poppins Returns and Doctor Wren in Gwen (2018). He has portrayed Crispus Allen in the superhero film Justice League (2017), part of the DC Extended Universe.\n\nFor his performance in Tina in the West End, he won the Laurence Olivier Award for Best Actor in a Musical.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kobna Holdbrook-Smith, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:42:14+00:00","tmdbId":202775,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/202775","credits":[{"id":"doctor-strange","title":"Doctor Strange","character":"Physical Therapist"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/kobna-holdbrook-smith.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Narnia: The Magician's Nephew","year":2027,"character":"Frank","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yrqR0qquy4JOfqZCsFJV7vJoOSh.jpg"},{"name":"The Sheep Detectives","year":2026,"character":"Reverend Hillcoate","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iKy5460GdsoknM8ppmGlJbKxAKa.jpg"},{"name":"National Theatre Live: Coriolanus","year":2025,"character":"Tullus Aufidius","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tJPilzXnfUHeXd1G8NFCPIFDFJf.jpg"},{"name":"The Gorge","year":2025,"character":"Black Ops Commander","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg"},{"name":"End of Play","year":2025,"character":"The Caretaker","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1WW99MZ5eRcsRAIcD98JzmGB8Ra.jpg"},{"name":"Wolf King","year":2025,"character":"Master Hogan (voice)","mediaType":"tv",